      "notes": "The channel index is IN THE COMMAND, not a parameter, so the reply lands on `Reading/channel_settings_4/scale` and a four-strip panel can tell its channels apart. A parameterised verb answers under one name whichever channel it read, which no per-channel display can bind to. Authored 2026-08-08 for the tabbed oscilloscope panel; not yet executed against hardware.",
